{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/Explore_banner.png?t=1742077692\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/ezgif.com-gif-maker.gif?t=1742077692\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/Untitled-2.png?t=1742077692\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/Battle_gif.gif?t=1742077692\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Story </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been summoned by an enigmatic entity to prevent the end of this world. Explore the dark remains of post-apocalyptic structures, face nightmarish creatures, and befriend a colorful cast of characters in this story-rich RPG.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An interconnected original world to be explored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An action bullet-hell combat system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unfold an original and thrilling story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A colorful and chaotic cast of characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique equipable items to create your own fighting style.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1484890?t=1742077692","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742077692","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742077692","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i